@guide H_WesternPlaguelands
@name Western Plaguelands (The Bulwark)
@faction Horde
@levels 54-58
@zone Western Plaguelands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc The Bulwark: the Scourge cauldron chain, the plagued farms, Andorhal and the wildlife quests. At 58 go straight to the Dark Portal.
@next Both_EasternPlaguelands

accept 5094 A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands! [zone=Undercity] | Harbinger Balthazad in the Undercity (Warcaller Gorlach in Orgrimmar has the same quest). Needed for the Bulwark chain.
turnin 5094 A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands! [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | High Executor Derrington, the Bulwark.
accept Scarlet Diversions [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | High Executor Derrington, the Bulwark.
complete Scarlet Diversions | Plant the banner at the Scarlet camp in the north and kill Scarlet troops.
turnin Scarlet Diversions [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | Turned in at Tirisfal Glades.
accept All Along the Watchtowers [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | High Executor Derrington.
accept The Scourge Cauldrons [zone=Tirisfal Glades]
turnin The Scourge Cauldrons [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | Shadow Priestess Vandis.
accept Target: Felstone Field [zone=Tirisfal Glades]
complete Target: Felstone Field | The cauldron at Felstone Field; kill the Cauldron Lord for the key.
turnin Target: Felstone Field
accept Return to the Bulwark
complete All Along the Watchtowers | Mark the three watchtowers in Andorhal with the torch.
accept A Matter of Time | Chromie in the ruined inn at Andorhal.
complete A Matter of Time | Use the Temporal Displacer by the silos in Andorhal and kill the Temporal Parasites that appear.
turnin A Matter of Time
accept Counting Out Time
complete Counting Out Time | Andorhal Watches from the small lockboxes in the Andorhal houses.
turnin Counting Out Time
turnin Return to the Bulwark [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | Turned in at Tirisfal Glades.
turnin All Along the Watchtowers [zone=Tirisfal Glades]
accept Target: Dalson's Tears [zone=Tirisfal Glades]
complete Target: Dalson's Tears | The cauldron at Dalson's Tears.
turnin Target: Dalson's Tears
accept Mrs. Dalson's Diary [optional] | The diary in the Dalson farmhouse.
turnin Mrs. Dalson's Diary [optional]
accept 5060 Locked Away | The locked cabinet in the farmhouse.
complete 5060 Locked Away | Farmer Dalson, upstairs in the barn, drops the cabinet key.
turnin 5060 Locked Away
accept 5232 Return to the Bulwark
turnin 5232 Return to the Bulwark [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | Turned in at Tirisfal Glades.
accept Target: Writhing Haunt [zone=Tirisfal Glades]
complete Target: Writhing Haunt | The cauldron at the Writhing Haunt.
accept The Wildlife Suffers Too | Mulgris Deepriver, the Weeping Cave.
complete The Wildlife Suffers Too | Diseased wolves.
turnin The Wildlife Suffers Too
accept 4985 The Wildlife Suffers Too
complete 4985 The Wildlife Suffers Too | Diseased Grizzlies.
turnin 4985 The Wildlife Suffers Too
turnin Target: Writhing Haunt
accept 5234 Return to the Bulwark
accept A Plague Upon Thee [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | Mickey Levine, the Bulwark.
complete A Plague Upon Thee | Termite barrels at the Northridge Lumber Camp.
turnin A Plague Upon Thee [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | Turned in at Tirisfal Glades.
turnin 5234 Return to the Bulwark [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | Turned in at Tirisfal Glades.
accept Target: Gahrron's Withering [zone=Tirisfal Glades]
complete Target: Gahrron's Withering | The cauldron at Gahrron's Withering.
turnin Target: Gahrron's Withering
accept 5236 Return to the Bulwark
turnin 5236 Return to the Bulwark [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | Turned in at Tirisfal Glades.
accept Mission Accomplished! [zone=Tirisfal Glades]
turnin Mission Accomplished! [zone=Tirisfal Glades] | Turned in at Tirisfal Glades.
level 57
train
note Next: the Eastern Plaguelands, east along the Thondroril River.
